OL,3,GNEWSAMP criticises Channel 4
OL,4,Adocumentary about ADHD
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP with attention deficit
OL,7,Fhyperactivity disorder (ADHD) has
OL,8,Fcriticised a Channel 4 documentary
OL,9,Fabout the condition, claiming it was
OL,10,F"unfactual".
OL,12,FDescribing the documentary as "boring",
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat MP for Yeovil Adam
OL,14,FDance said some aspects of the
OL,15,Fdocumentary were "not reflective of
OL,16,Freal life".
OL,18,FThe programme, The Great ADHD Myth?,
OL,19,Fwas broadcast on Tuesday and its host,
OL,20,FNHS psychiatrist Dr Max Pemberton,
OL,21,Fconcluded ADHD was "a social construct,
OL,22,Fnot a disorder of the brain".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
